          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can a 240V generator charge an electric car?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Often, at a reduced rate. Set your Level 2 charger to around 16 amps so the load stays near 3,800 watts, and expect some chargers to refuse generator power because of how the neutral and ground are bonded. It is slow and expensive per mile, so treat it as an emergency option."
          }
        },
