          <a href="#outlets" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. L14-30 vs 14-50 vs L5-30</a>
          <a href="#split-phase" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Split-Phase and Selectors</a>
